Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Tally agent Windows ke liye ek chhota sa desktop application hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.17,0:00:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Downloads section se agent installer download kariye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.58,0:00:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Double click karke run kariye — Next, Next, Install.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.92,0:00:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,30 second mein install ho jaayega.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Icon system tray mein aa jaayega — right bottom corner mein.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.95,0:00:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Right click karke Open kariye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.88,0:00:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ek chhota window kholega — apna FLOWRA login credentials daaliye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.05,0:00:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Bas!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.45,0:00:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ab har raat 2 baje ye agent apne aap aapka Tally data cloud pe bhejega.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.01,0:00:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Aapko kuch nahi karna — Tally chalu rakhen bas.
